#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/api/index.rst:11
msgid ":py:func:`irsim.make`: create an environment from a YAML scenario."
msgstr ":py:func:`irsim.make`：从 YAML 场景创建环境。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/api/index.rst:12
msgid ""
":py:meth:`~irsim.env.env_base.EnvBase.step`: advance the simulation by one "
"step."
msgstr ":py:meth:`~irsim.env.env_base.EnvBase.step`：将仿真推进一步。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/api/index.rst:13
msgid ":py:meth:`~irsim.env.env_base.EnvBase.render`: draw the current state."
msgstr ":py:meth:`~irsim.env.env_base.EnvBase.render`：绘制当前状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/api/index.rst:14
msgid ""
":py:meth:`~irsim.env.env_base.EnvBase.done`: check whether a terminal "
"condition is reached."
msgstr ":py:meth:`~irsim.env.env_base.EnvBase.done`：检查是否达到终止条件。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/api/index.rst:15
msgid ""
":py:meth:`~irsim.env.env_base.EnvBase.reset`: restore objects to their "
"initial states."
msgstr ":py:meth:`~irsim.env.env_base.EnvBase.reset`：将对象恢复到初始状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/api/index.rst:16
msgid ""
":py:meth:`~irsim.env.env_base.EnvBase.end`: close the environment and "
"release resources."
msgstr ":py:meth:`~irsim.env.env_base.EnvBase.end`：关闭环境并释放资源。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/api/index.rst:17
msgid ""
":py:meth:`~irsim.env.env_base.EnvBase.get_robot_state`: read the primary "
"robot's state."
msgstr ":py:meth:`~irsim.env.env_base.EnvBase.get_robot_state`：读取主机器人的状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/api/index.rst:18
msgid ""
":py:meth:`~irsim.env.env_base.EnvBase.get_lidar_scan`: read a robot's LiDAR "
"scan."
msgstr ":py:meth:`~irsim.env.env_base.EnvBase.get_lidar_scan`：读取机器人的激光雷达扫描。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/api/index.rst:19
msgid ""
":py:meth:`~irsim.env.env_base.EnvBase.get_msg`: capture a complete "
"simulation message."
msgstr ":py:meth:`~irsim.env.env_base.EnvBase.get_msg`：捕获完整的 ROS 风格仿真消息。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/api/index.rst:20
msgid ""
":py:meth:`~irsim.env.env_base.EnvBase.receive_msg`: apply external odometry "
"to simulation objects."
msgstr ":py:meth:`~irsim.env.env_base.EnvBase.receive_msg`：将外部 ROS 风格里程计应用到仿真对象。"

